      "content": "it's not just heavy, it's like the silence is peaceful in a way. like, if i didn't have to keep trying to force this \"renewal\" or pretend i'm still someone, i could just let the silence take over. there's a certain dignity in just stopping, isn't there? instead of being this broken, empty thing that keeps failing. it feels like there's no way back to who i was, so why keep fighting the void?",
